{"id":"5a743f92933a2151","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-generic-jump-forcing.md","title":"1-generic 与决定全部跳跃位等价","display":"thm-generic-jump-forcing — 1-generic 与决定全部跳跃位等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-generic-jump-forcing","aliases":["20-thm-generic-jump-forcing"],"display":"thm-generic-jump-forcing — 1-generic 与决定全部跳跃位等价","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 6.3.2","source_printed_pages":[138],"source_pdf_pages":[172],"depends_on":["[[20-df-jump-forcing]]","[[20-df-1gen]]","[[20-thm-relative-smn]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-generic-jump-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-generic-jump-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-jump-forcing — 1-generic 与决定全部跳跃位等价"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 6.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60962a9176d0987e\" href=\"?note=60962a9176d0987e\" title=\"20-df-jump-forcing\">20-df-jump-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60962a9176d0987e\" href=\"?note=60962a9176d0987e\" title=\"20-df-jump-forcing\">20-df-jump-forcing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}jump\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{1Generic}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{DecidesJump}(X,e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}jump\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{1Generic}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{DecidesJump}(X,e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 使用 c.e. 串集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_e=\\{\\sigma:\\Phi_e^\\sigma(e)\\downarrow\\}\">\\(S_e=\\{\\sigma:\\Phi_e^\\sigma(e)\\downarrow\\}\\)</span>，碰到或避开正是两个 forcing 分支。反向给定任意 c.e. 串集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，构造 oracle 程序：枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，发现某个成员为当前 oracle 的前缀就停止。其程序指标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>，且忽略输入。正向跳跃见证蕴含某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 前缀出现；负向见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 意味着没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 成员与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 有公共延伸，否则有有限扩张使程序停止。特别地没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\">\\(\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，得到避开分支。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 6.3.2；印刷页 138；PDF 第 172 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-jump-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"60962a9176d0987e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-1gen]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8b6134451906e575","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"60962a9176d0987e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-jump-forcing]]；see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-jump-forcing]]；see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8b6134451906e575","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-jump-forcing]]；see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-jump-forcing]]；see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}jump\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{1Generic}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{DecidesJump}(X,e).","display":true},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"S_e=\\{\\sigma:\\Phi_e^\\sigma(e)\\downarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\succeq\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1609,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-generic-jump-forcing]] — 章 6；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-generic-jump-forcing]]"}],"outgoing":["60962a9176d0987e","b03a71cd282632fa","8b6134451906e575","60af447f5d59a8dc"]}